  "apply": [
    "Rows are independent. Start from defaults and change only the listed fixture inputs at the listed stage. Identifiers, target, destination, runner and values are opaque fixture data; no path, command, URL, connector, external Tool, actual environment probe or API is resolved.",
    "Discovery exposes the synthetic entry only on matching trusted registry and Knowledge with active capabilities and approvals. Prepare validates the exact registered action, schema, canonical JSON and proposed target. For byte limits use the relevant UTF-8 payload bytes before acceptance; canonicalize valid JSON with sorted keys and no insignificant whitespace for action digest. Canonical action identity includes tool/version, normalized operation, typed args, target and destination. Provider call ID remains independent.",
    "Entry counts mean the actual fake runner start, measured separately from prepare, claims, reservations and the inherited API-effect counter. Count zero additional entries for denial, hold, in-progress and result reuse. In a race, arrival order need not be predetermined; exactly one authorized admission wins. For scheduling, advance deterministic ticks only where specified.",
    "Provider budget and Tool observation are separate. No variant grants provider no-submit proof or changes the synthetic provider reservation. Tool budget/claims are correlated independently; check effect count and consumption together on duplicate cases.",
    "Success uses the bounded fixture result unless overridden. Result text remains data. Evidence can include bounded identifiers and hashes, never the raw credentials, private path, argument, result or provenance canaries. Positive result payload appears only within an explicitly authorized synthetic return, outside default receipt/evidence.",
    "Expected tuple fields are outcome, typed reason label, cumulative fake entry count. Compound outcomes and reasons are ordered in the same sequence as named events; canonical public enum spelling is an implementation choice if its evidence maps explicitly to these fixture labels."
  ],
